      "section": "Mathematics and Science",
      "subject": "Mathematics: Arithmetic & Algebra",
      "question_en": "A sum of money doubles itself in 5 years at simple interest. What is the annual rate of interest?",
      "question_hi": "कोई धनराशि साधारण ब्याज पर 5 वर्षों में दोगुनी हो जाती है। वार्षिक ब्याज दर क्या है?",
      "options": [
        "15% per annum",
        "20% per annum",
        "25% per annum",
        "10% per annum"
      ],
      "ans": 1,
      "explanation": "SI = P => P = P × R × 5 / 100 => R = 100 / 5 = 20%."
